sing out of your employment will be resolved by final and binding arbitration rather than in court. This provision is optional and its enforceability varies by state; it should be reviewed by counsel before use.6. ContingenciesThis offer of employment is contingent upon satisfactory reference checks. If any contingency is not satisfied, the Company may withdraw this offer.7. Governing LawThis agreement is governed by the laws of the State of North Dakota, without regard to its conflict-of-laws principles. If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in full force and effect.8. Acknowledgment & AcceptanceBy signing below, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this offer and agreement, that your employment is at-will, and that this letter contains the full terms of the offer. Any prior verbal or written representations that conflict with these terms are superseded.EmployeeSignatureName: Sample 5Date: _______________________For Sample 1SignatureName: Sample 3Title: Sample 4Date: _______________________Disclaimer: This tool generates a general-purpose at-will offer/agreement and is not legal advice. At-will rules and required notices vary by state (e.g., Montana), have it reviewed by an attorney before use.






